    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What can her do?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch you while you work, changing poses and expressions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit, lie or stand next to you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Affectionately call you by name</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dance and show cute tricks at your request</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greeting you in the morning, supporting you in difficult times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can have up to 5 waifus at the same time!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to do with her?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hug</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make you happy her money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send her on vacation if she's in the way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite her to dance</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What can be changed?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 ready-made models to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to upload your own VRM model</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 voiceovers to choose from (Japanese and Chinese voices)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 headwear options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload your own headwear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workshop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul>",
